### MediFlow — Surgery service qua gateway :8080
### Yêu cầu: các route hiện hữu cần case đã tồn tại; create cần approved request/authority và gate riêng.
### Bật Surgery business gate và Gateway Surgery route chỉ trong môi trường test/local được nghiệm thu.
### MEDIFLOW_FEATURES_SURGERY_ENABLED=true và MEDIFLOW_GATEWAY_SURGERY_ENABLED=true; messaging vẫn off.

@host = http://localhost:8080
# @token = paste-access-token-here
# @surgeryCaseId = paste-existing-case-id-here
# @caseRevision = paste-current-case-revision-here
# @idempotencyKey = cancel-unique-operation-key
# @beginPreopIdempotencyKey = begin-preop-unique-operation-key
# @correlationId = paste-correlation-uuid-here
# @scheduleRevision = paste-current-schedule-revision-or-0-here
# @roomId = paste-authoritative-active-operating-room-id-here
# @surgeonId = paste-explicitly-qualified-staff-id-here
# @scheduleIdempotencyKey = unique-schedule-operation-key

# @surgeryRequestId = canonical-lowercase-uuid-of-approved-request
# @careEpisodeId = exact-selected-appointment-or-record-id
# @recordId = exact-source-record-id
# @patientId = exact-patient-id
# @departmentId = approved-department-id
# @requesterStaffId = approved-source-requester-staff-id
# @procedureCode = approved-procedure-code
# @plannedItemCode = approved-item-code
# @priceCode = billing-catalogue-code
# @readinessIdempotencyKey = unique-readiness-operation-key
# @finalizeIdempotencyKey = unique-finalize-operation-key
# @startIdempotencyKey = unique-start-operation-key
# @completeIdempotencyKey = unique-complete-operation-key
# @methodCode = approved-actual-method-code
# @outcomeCode = approved-controlled-outcome-code
# @performedItemId = unique-surgery-owned-performed-line-uuid
# @performedItemCode = approved-actual-item-code
# @actualStartAt = actual-performed-start-iso-instant
# @actualEndAt = actual-performed-end-iso-instant

### Tạo ca — ADMIN/DOCTOR có signed staffId; API mặc định tắt, không phải bypass referral
### Cần BOTH business + MEDIFLOW_SURGERY_CREATION_API_ENABLED=true và real creation authority provider.
### Gateway route/policy do Hoàng Anh nghiệm thu riêng; mẫu này không xác nhận gateway đã cho POST.
### Idempotency-Key phải bằng surgeryRequestId canonical; 201 + Location, replay 200 + cùng receipt.
### Đổi requestedAt/template/codes theo nguồn được phê duyệt; không tự tạo UUID quan hệ.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{surgeryRequestId}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "surgeryRequestId": "{{surgeryRequestId}}",
  "careEpisodeType": "OUTPATIENT_VISIT",
  "careEpisodeId": "{{careEpisodeId}}",
  "admissionId": null,
  "recordId": "{{recordId}}",
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}",
  "requestedBy": "{{requesterStaffId}}",
  "procedureCode": "{{procedureCode}}",
  "indication": "Approved clinical indication from source request",
  "priority": "ROUTINE",
  "requestedAt": "2026-10-07T08:00:00Z",
  "templateRevision": 1,
  "plannedItems": [{"itemCode": "{{plannedItemCode}}", "priceCode": "{{priceCode}}", "quantity": 1}]
}

### Chuẩn bị/đổi lịch nháp — ADMIN/MANAGER/DOCTOR; không reserve, không READY
### Đổi ca READY/SCHEDULED sẽ invalidate về PREOP và release booking cũ, phải đánh giá/chốt lại
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{scheduleIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedScheduleRevision": {{scheduleRevision}},
  "roomId": "{{roomId}}",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-06T08:00:00Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-10-06T10:00:00Z",
  "team": [{"staffId": "{{surgeonId}}", "role": "PRIMARY_SURGEON"}]
}

### Chi tiết ca — ADMIN/MANAGER toàn khoa; DOCTOR/NURSE khoa hiện tại từ Organization
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Board — không có narrative/chữ ký/evidence, page 0; size tối đa 100
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases?page=0&size=20&status=PREOP_IN_PROGRESS
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

### Khoảng requested UTC [from,until); planned period lọc overlap, không chứng minh đã đặt phòng
GET {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases?requestedFrom=2026-10-05T00:00:00Z&requestedUntil=2026-10-06T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bắt đầu pre-op — ADMIN/DOCTOR; actor lấy từ access token đã xác thực
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/preop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{beginPreopIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}}
}

### Checklist — ADMIN/DOCTOR/NURSE, signed staff; business + preop API gates OFF by default
### Gateway acceptance and real authority provider pending; use exact pinned evidence references
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/checklist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checklist-command-key
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "checklistItemId": "{{checklistItemId}}",
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedSnapshotRevision": {{checklistSnapshotRevision}},
  "expectedItemRevision": {{checklistItemRevision}},
  "status": "SATISFIED",
  "evidenceReferenceId": "{{evidenceReferenceId}}",
  "evidenceRevision": {{evidenceRevision}}
}

### Consent — same roles/gates/mandatory authority; new 201+Location, authorized replay 200
### Signer/document inputs never establish legal authority; no consent revoke HTTP mapping
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/consents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: consent-command-key
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "consentType": "SURGERY",
  "signerId": "{{signerId}}",
  "signerType": "PATIENT",
  "evidenceDocumentId": "{{evidenceDocumentId}}"
}

### Hủy ca trước khi phẫu thuật bắt đầu — ADMIN/DOCTOR; replay cùng key trả lại kết quả gốc
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "reason": "Patient requested cancellation"
}

### Lifecycle API: mặc định OFF; cần business + mediflow.surgery.lifecycle.api.enabled và real use-case/authority beans.
### Gateway policy/activation nghiệm thu riêng bởi Hoàng Anh. Không tự bật production để thử các request này.
### Evaluate READY — ADMIN/DOCTOR; case/schedule revision lấy đúng từ trạng thái hiện tại.
### NOT_READY + blockingReasons là quyết định từ chối, không phải READY thành công; replay không evaluate lại.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/readiness/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{readinessIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedScheduleRevision": {{scheduleRevision}}
}

### Finalize — ADMIN/MANAGER/DOCTOR; READY + current DRAFT, reserve resources; không phải PUT lịch nháp.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/schedule/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{finalizeIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedScheduleRevision": {{scheduleRevision}}
}

### Start — ADMIN/DOCTOR; recheck current guards, không override tài chính; dùng revision mới sau finalize.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{startIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedScheduleRevision": {{scheduleRevision}}
}

### Complete — ADMIN/DOCTOR; IN_PROGRESS, actual times/codes; không dùng planned times hay tự tính tiền.
### Quantity dương, tối đa 15 chữ số nguyên / 4 thập phân; không làm tròn để vừa SQL.
### Same key/body replay giữ result/time gốc; đổi body cùng key conflict, V1 không correction/abort.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/surgery/cases/{{surgeryCaseId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{completeIdempotencyKey}}
X-Correlation-Id: {{correlationId}}

{
  "expectedCaseRevision": {{caseRevision}},
  "expectedScheduleRevision": {{scheduleRevision}},
  "procedureCode": "{{procedureCode}}",
  "methodCode": "{{methodCode}}",
  "outcomeCode": "{{outcomeCode}}",
  "complicationGroupCode": null,
  "actualStartAt": "{{actualStartAt}}",
  "actualEndAt": "{{actualEndAt}}",
  "performedItems": [{"performedItemId": "{{performedItemId}}", "itemCode": "{{performedItemCode}}", "priceCode": "{{priceCode}}", "quantity": 1}]
}
